            <span class="wg-card-kind kind-vc">ViewComponent</span>
        </div>
        <span class="wg-card-path">src/Sections/Humans.Shifts/Views/Shared/_VolunteerHeatmap.cshtml</span>
    </div>
    <div class="wg-card-note">
        Not rendered here: the single-user build heatmap (<code>_VolunteerHeatmap</code>, <code>ShowAvailabilityControls=true</code>) renders on the
        <a href="/Profile/Me">profile</a>; the full-tracking variant (<code>_VolunteerUnbookedHeatmap</code>) needs the whole
        <code>VolunteerTrackingPageViewModel</code>. See <a href="/Shifts/Dashboard/VolunteerTracking">/Shifts/Dashboard/VolunteerTracking</a>.
    </div>
